    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Pop Team Epic",
        "jpn": "ポプテピピック"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Crude, rude, and a little…cute? Get ready for the larger-than-life attitude of Popuko and Pipimi, the small and tall stars of Pop Team Epic! Based off the bizarre four-panel webcomic by Bukubu Okawa comes a comedy that’ll throw you off with its out-there jokes and intense absurdity. You think you’re ready for these girls? Think again, F#%**er!",
        "jpn": "「とびっきりのクソ4コマ!!」「大人気打ち切り漫画!」としてカルト的人気を博したあの漫画が、なんとアニメ化。\r\n煽るのは好きだが煽られるとキレまくるポプ子と、そんなポプ子が\"いっぱいちゅき\"なピピ美…。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Poputepipikku",
        "Pop Team Epic (2022)"
    ],
